## Vendored ShapePlan cache maintenance

`crates/cosmic-text-patched` backports the `(font, direction, script)`
`ShapePlan` cache from cosmic-text 0.17 to GPUI CE's 0.14 dependency. The crate
is excluded from workspace resolution, activated by the root Cargo patch, and
formatted/tested separately by the Makefile.

Before removing it, confirm `cargo tree -p gpui-ce --depth 1 | rg cosmic`
resolves cosmic-text 0.17 or newer, remove the root patch/exclude and standalone
Makefile hooks together, run the canonical targets, and profile a cold chat
scroll. A clean compile alone does not prove the original
`find_language_feature` hotspot is gone.
